OL,4,BChelsea fined #150,000 for             
OL,5,Bdiscriminatory chanting                
OL,6,GChelsea have been fined #150,000 by    
OL,7,Gthe Football Association as part of a  
OL,8,Gpunishment for anti-Catholic and anti- 
OL,9,GIrish chants during an FA Cup third-   
OL,10,Ground win at Charlton Athletic in      
OL,11,GJanuary.                               
OL,13,FThe club have also been warned about   
OL,14,Ftheir future conduct and had an action 
OL,15,Fplan imposed on them in relation to    
OL,16,Fthe offence.                           
